        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "○ 示例：在句子\"The cat that was chased by the dog ran away.\"中，Self-Attention 能正確捕捉\"cat\"與\"ran\"的關聯，即使中間隔了許多詞。",
            "block_bbox": [
